{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新しばらく出来なくてごめなさいーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/5013376/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校の行きに撮ったお空の写真。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/5013376/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"綺麗だな～と思って思わず撮ったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまにね、なんとなく空見上げるの、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「生きてる。」って感じする..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にっこり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"只今テストなうですあみあみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/5013376/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ってるよー学生も！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日で終わりだから悔いないように頑張らなくちゃ！！！むしゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/5013376/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前の写真でごめなさぁい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪もやっとこさ治ってきました（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも今日テスト中、わたすこのまま死ぬのかい？と思うくらい咳が止まらなくて焦った！(◎_◎;)ぎぇ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやぁねぇー夏風邪はやっかいだよ本当。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなも本当気を付けてね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんじゃあみは勉強に戻りまーす！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もー本当だれかあみの家庭教師になってつきっきりでお勉強おしえてくれぇーー笑"}],"source":"archive"}